        "en": "A 30-second upbeat indie-pop jingle for a coffee shop launch — warm\nelectric piano lead, brushed drums, gentle bass, a single sun-soaked\n\"ahhh\" choir on the chorus. No vocals. Loop-friendly tail.",
        "zh-CN": "使用这个插件完成以下任务：A 30-second upbeat indie-pop jingle for a coffee shop launch — warm\nelectric piano lead, brushed drums, gentle bass, a single sun-soaked\n\"ahhh\" choir on the chorus. No vocals. Loop-friendly tail."
      },
